== 6. every refusal forms.b makes, with a control beside it ==
-- a @field nothing scans
   site:    scan / a @field on a type that is not a @form
   faults:  latte$entry.LooseField.a is a @field but latte$entry.LooseField is not a @form, so nothing would ever bind it
