-- BLOCKERS.md B1a
   site:    bind_fields / a @field declared by a generic type
   faults:  latte$entry.OrderForm.caption is a @field declared by latte$entry.Rows<int>; a reflective write to a field whose declaring type is generic is ok under beansc run and unsupported natively (BLOCKERS.md B1a), so latte refuses it here rather than at request time
